{
 "suite": "tactics@2",
 "created": "2026-11-15",
 "about": "Positions with one right line, seat 0 to find it. The entrant plays both seats from the given step. Goals: win (seat 0 wins before the turn `turns` after this one ends), survive (seat 0 is alive when the turn after `turns` more begins), remove (seat 1 no longer controls `card`), keep (seat 0 still controls `card`), life (seat 0 has at least `life`). Libraries are 20 of the seat's first basic land unless given. Changing a puzzle makes a new version. tactics@2 is tactics@1's 16 puzzles and 15 more (trample, flying and reach, pumps after blocks, exert, deathtouch blocks, counters and protection on the opponent's turn, and traps: a wrath when ahead, a removal spell that costs the last life).",
